{title: 235 - Christ Is Made the Sure Foundation}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #235 • EDEN CHURCH • 8.7.8.7.7.7}
{lyricist: John M. Neale}
{composer: Dale Wood}
{key: Eb}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 235}
{meta: tune EDEN CHURCH}
{meta: meter 8.7.8.7.7.7}
{meta: category Jesus Christ - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Cm]Christ [Gm]is [Fm]made [Gm]the [Cm]sure [Gm]foundation,
[Ab]Christ, [Gm]our [Fm]head and [Cm/G]cornerstone,
[Cm]Chosen of [Bb/F]the [Eb]Lord [G7/B]and precious,
[Cm]Binding [Eb]all [Fm]the [Cm/G]Church [Gm]in [Cm]one;
[Cm]Holy Zion's [Gm]help [Ab]forever
[Db]And our [Eb]confidence [Gm]alone.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Cm]To [Gm]this [Fm]temple [Cm]where [Gm]we call [Cm]You,
[Ab]Come, [Gm]O [Fm]Lord of [Cm/G]hosts, [Gm]and [Cm]stay;
[Cm]Come, [Bb]with [Cm/G]all [Bb/F]Your [Eb]loving [G7/B]kindness,
[Cm]Hear [Bb7]Your [Eb]people [Cm/G]as [Gm]they [Cm]pray;
[Cm]And Your fullest [Ab]benediction
[Db]Shed within [Gm]these [Ab]walls [Gm]today.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[Cm]Grant, [Gm]we [Fm]pray [Gm]to [Cm]all [Gm]Your faithful
[Ab]All [Gm]the [Fm]gifts they [Cm/G]ask [Gm]to [Cm]gain;
[Cm]What [Bb]they [Cm/G]gain [Bb/F]from [Eb]You [G7/B]forever
[Cm]With [Bb7]the [Eb]blessed [Fm]to [Cm/G]retain;
[Cm]And hereafter [Ab]in [Bb]Your [Cm]glory
[Db]Evermore [Gm]with [Ab]You [Gm]to [Cm]reign.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
[Cm]Praise [Gm]and [Fm]honor [Cm]to [Gm]the Father,
[Ab]Praise [Gm]and [Fm]honor [Cm/G]to [Gm]the [Cm]Son,
[Cm]Praise [Bb]and [Cm/G]honor [Eb]to [G7/B]the Spirit,
[Cm]Ever [Eb]three [Fm]and [Cm/G]ever one:
[Cm]One in might [Gm]and [Ab]one [Bb]in [Cm]glory
[Db]While unending [Ab]ages [Cm]run!
{end_of_verse}
